/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 1:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the core philosophy of 'Rapid Prototyping' in Design Thinking \('Fail early and cheap to succeed sooner'\). How does building low-fidelity artifacts prevent the psychological 'Sunk Cost Trap' in software engineering?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Epistemological Philosophy of Prototyping:) Tj
T*
(   - Prototyping is not about building the final product; it is a generative learning vehicle) Tj
T*
(   designed to test hypotheses, explore boundary conditions, and externalize mental models.) Tj
T*
(   - 'Thinking with your hands' transforms abstract, ambiguous conceptual debates into tangible,) Tj
T*
(   testable artifacts.) Tj
T*
(   - 'Fail early and cheap to succeed sooner': Uncovering a fatal flaw on a $5 paper sketch takes) Tj
T*
(   20 minutes; uncovering the same flaw in deployed production code takes 6 months, hundreds of) Tj
T*
(   thousands of dollars, and risks catastrophic brand erosion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Sunk Cost Fallacy in Software Engineering:) Tj
T*
(   - When developers spend weeks writing intricate production-grade code, unit tests, and database) Tj
T*
(   schemas for an untested concept, they develop deep emotional and cognitive attachment.) Tj
T*
(   - When early user testing reveals that the core feature is confusing or unwanted, developers) Tj
T*
(   rationalise, defend, or resist scrapping it because of the immense capital and emotional energy) Tj
T*
(   already sunk into the code.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Low-Fidelity Prototyping as an Antidote:) Tj
T*
(   - Low-fidelity artifacts \(paper sketches, index cards, rough wireframes\) take minutes to) Tj
T*
(   construct and carry zero emotional attachment.) Tj
T*
(   - When a user rejects a paper screen, the designer crumples it into the recycling bin with a) Tj
T*
(   laugh and draws a new layout in 60 seconds, maintaining agile experimental velocity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
