(   [Problem Statement]: Deconstruct the 'Wizard of Oz' prototyping methodology. Detail its operational execution for validating an AI-driven automated code-review assistant before training machine learning models.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Conceptual Foundation of Wizard of Oz \(WOz\):) Tj
T*
(   - Named after the classic tale where a hidden man behind a curtain operated a terrifying) Tj
T*
(   magical illusion.) Tj
T*
(   - The user interacts with what appears to be a fully automated, intelligent software system,) Tj
T*
(   but the computational processing, reasoning, and logic are executed manually behind the scenes) Tj
T*
(   by a hidden human operator.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Operational Protocol for AI Code-Review Assistant Validation:) Tj
T*
(   - Frontend User Experience:) Tj
T*
(   * A real VS Code extension is built with a simple 'Analyze Pull Request with AI' button.) Tj
T*
(   * When the developer clicks the button, a loading spinner animates: 'AI Neural Model Analyzing) Tj
T*
(   Codebase...'.) Tj
T*
(   - The Hidden 'Wizard' Infrastructure:) Tj
T*
(   * The extension does not call a 70-billion-parameter neural network. Instead, it pushes the) Tj
T*
(   GitHub PR diff to an internal Slack channel monitored by senior software architects.) Tj
T*
(   * The human architects read the diff, draft targeted, human-level architectural suggestions,) Tj
T*
(   and submit them through an admin portal within 3 minutes.) Tj
T*
(   * The VS Code extension populates the inline comments as if generated by 'Autonomous AI'.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Validated Learning Extracted at Zero Machine Learning Cost:) Tj
T*
(   - Measures genuine developer engagement: Do developers accept, reject, or ignore inline) Tj
T*
(   automated suggestions?) Tj
T*
(   - Uncovers the exact categories of code reviews developers find valuable \(e.g., architectural) Tj
T*
(   pattern suggestions vs. pedantic syntax formatting\).) Tj
T*
(   - Establishes the ground-truth labeled training dataset needed to train the actual machine) Tj
T*
(   learning model later!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
