(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the 'Concierge MVP' methodology. How does high-touch manual execution allow software engineering founders to discover unarticulated workflows before automating them?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Methodology of the Concierge MVP:) Tj
T*
(   - In a Concierge MVP, the value proposition is delivered to the customer as an explicit,) Tj
T*
(   high-touch personal service performed manually by the founders.) Tj
T*
(   - Unlike Wizard of Oz \(where manual operation is concealed behind a facade\), in a Concierge MVP) Tj
T*
(   the customer knows a human is providing the service.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Deep Discovery of Unarticulated Workflows:) Tj
T*
(   - Case Study: Food on the Table \(Manuel Rosso\):) Tj
T*
(   * Concept: An app that suggests weekly meal recipes based on a family's dietary preferences and) Tj
T*
(   matches ingredients to local grocery store sales coupons.) Tj
T*
(   * Concierge Execution: Rosso did not write software. He personally met with a single mother in) Tj
T*
(   Austin, Texas each week. He interviewed her on family food likes, walked through grocery store) Tj
T*
(   aisles with coupons, and planned her weekly dinners by hand for a $10 fee.) Tj
T*
(   * Insights Uncovered: He discovered that she didn't care about gourmet recipes; her primary) Tj
T*
(   anxiety was managing finicky children and finding recipes that took under 20 minutes to cook on) Tj
T*
(   school nights.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. The Automation Transition:) Tj
T*
(   - When Rosso expanded the service to 20 families manually, patterns solidified: recurring) Tj
T*
(   grocery item lists, standard recipe structures.) Tj
T*
(   - He only began writing software when manual execution hit capacity limits, ensuring that every) Tj
T*
(   single automated software feature encoded a verified, battle-tested human workflow.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 10:) Tj
T*
