(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the 'Piecemeal MVP' technique. Detail how the founders of Groupon cobwebbed existing software platforms \(WordPress, Apple Mail, FileMaker\) to launch a billion-dollar company.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Architecture of a Piecemeal MVP:) Tj
T*
(   - A Piecemeal MVP builds an operational product entirely by chaining together existing,) Tj
T*
(   off-the-shelf third-party software, plugins, and services.) Tj
T*
(   - It eliminates months of custom frontend and backend software engineering, testing whether the) Tj
T*
(   market ecosystem functions before committing engineering capital.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Groupon Genesis Case Study \(Andrew Mason, 2008\):) Tj
T*
(   - The Vision: Collective social buying: offering massive discounts at local businesses if a) Tj
T*
(   minimum threshold of consumers agreed to buy together.) Tj
T*
(   - The Piecemeal Toolchain:) Tj
T*
ET

