(   [Problem Statement]: Evaluate the 'Smoke Screen' \(Landing Page Smoke Test\) MVP methodology. What are its core quantitative metrics \(Conversion Funnel\), and how does an engineering team maintain ethical transparency?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Mechanics of the Smoke Screen Experiment:) Tj
T*
(   - A smoke screen test launches a high-converting landing page advertising a prospective) Tj
T*
(   product's value proposition, feature set, and pricing tiers before the product exists.) Tj
T*
(   - It measures actual behavioral commitment rather than passive verbal interest.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Quantitative Metrics Across the Conversion Funnel:) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 1: Top-of-Funnel Traffic: Total unique visitors acquired through targeted search ads or) Tj
T*
(   community posts \(Visitors = 10,000\).) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 2: Engagement / Scroll Depth: Percentage of visitors who scroll through feature) Tj
T*
(   breakdowns or watch an explainer video \(Engagement Rate = 45%\).) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 3: Conversion Intent \(The Primary Metric\): Percentage of visitors who click the primary) Tj
T*
(   action button: 'Buy Pre-Order - $49' or 'Start Free Trial' \(CTR = 8.2%\).) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 4: High-Friction Commitment: Visitors who input their email address on the subsequent) Tj
T*
(   screen to secure early access \(Email Capture Rate = 5.6%\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Ethical Transparency & Consumer Trust:) Tj
T*
(   - Never charge credit cards for non-existent products! That is fraud.) Tj
T*
(   - When the user clicks the CTA, immediately display an honest, transparent, and respectful) Tj
T*
(   modal:) Tj
T*
(   * 'Thank you for your enthusiasm! We are currently putting the finishing touches on our) Tj
T*
(   platform. Because you joined early, you are in our VIP beta cohort with a 50% lifetime) Tj
T*
(   discount. We will notify you the moment your account is ready.') Tj
T*
(   - This transforms what could feel like a deceptive trick into an exclusive VIP early-access) Tj
T*
(   invitation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
