(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the 'Mobile-First' wireframing methodology. Detail how designing within the extreme spatial constraints of a 375px mobile screen prevents feature bloat and optimizes information hierarchy.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Foundations of Mobile-First \(Luke Wroblewski\):) Tj
T*
(   - Historically, web software was designed for wide desktop displays \(1920x1080\) and) Tj
T*
(   subsequently squeezed down onto mobile phones \('Graceful Degradation'\), resulting in cramped,) Tj
T*
(   chaotic layouts.) Tj
T*
