T*
(   the foundational visual design decisions of a design system.) Tj
T*
(   - They replace hardcoded hex codes \(`#0066CC`\) and pixel values \(`16px`\) in frontend source) Tj
T*
(   code with semantic design variables, creating a single source of truth shared between designers) Tj
T*
(   and developers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
