(   3. Automated CI/CD Compilation Pipeline:) Tj
T*
(   - Build tools \(e.g., Style Dictionary\) ingest this JSON and compile it automatically into) Tj
T*
(   platform-specific code: CSS variables \(`var\(--color-brand-primary\)`\) for Web, Swift structs for) Tj
T*
(   iOS, and Kotlin theme objects for Android Compose, ensuring 100% design-code synchronization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
