(   [Problem Statement]: Construct a comprehensive 'User Flow' state machine for an autonomous vehicle mobile app summoning a driverless robotaxi, detailing all exception and cancellation states.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. State Machine Topology for Robotaxi Summoning:) Tj
T*
(   - State 1: Idle Map View: Displays user's current GPS location and nearby active robotaxis.) Tj
T*
(   * Transition -> User taps 'Set Pickup Location'.) Tj
T*
(   - State 2: Destination Entry & Pricing: User selects destination; backend calculates route,) Tj
T*
(   ETA, and fare.) Tj
T*
(   * Branch 1 -> User cancels: Return to State 1.) Tj
T*
(   * Branch 2 -> User taps 'Confirm Robotaxi': Transition to State 3.) Tj
T*
(   - State 3: Vehicle Dispatch & Matching: Backend matches nearest autonomous vehicle.) Tj
T*
(   * Exception A \(No Vehicles Available\): Display 'High Demand / All Cabs Busy', Button: 'Notify) Tj
T*
(   Me When Available' -> Return to State 1.) Tj
T*
(   * Success -> Matched vehicle assigned. Transition to State 4.) Tj
T*
(   - State 4: Vehicle En Route: Displays live vehicle GPS trajectory, license plate, and estimated) Tj
T*
(   arrival countdown.) Tj
T*
(   * User Action: 'Cancel Ride' -> If < 2 mins: Free cancellation -> State 1; If > 2 mins: Display) Tj
T*
ET

