T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Vanity Curiosity Trap:) Tj
T*
(   - Getting thousands of people to click a shiny Facebook ad or visit a landing page measures) Tj
T*
(   curiosity, not product viability. Curiosity is free and effortless; building a business on) Tj
T*
(   curiosity leads to immediate churn.) Tj
T*
(   - Customer Commitment represents the user's willingness to sacrifice something of value \(time,) Tj
T*
(   personal data, social reputation, or money\) to acquire the solution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Three Strategic Commitment Friction Mechanisms:) Tj
T*
