T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Taxonomy of Deceptive UX Dark Patterns:) Tj
T*
(   - Roach Motel \(Hard-to-Cancel Subscriptions\): Making account signup a frictionless 1-click) Tj
T*
(   flow, while requiring a 45-minute telephone call during business hours to cancel.) Tj
