(   2. Societal Harms & Regulatory Retaliation:) Tj
T*
(   - Dark patterns erode consumer trust, exploit vulnerable demographics \(the elderly, children,) Tj
T*
(   cognitively fatigued workers\), and are increasingly penalized with multi-million-dollar fines) Tj
T*
(   by the FTC and EU regulatory bodies under GDPR.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Institutionalizing Ethical Engineering Reviews:) Tj
T*
(   - The 'Front-Page-Newspaper Test': During sprint reviews, teams ask: 'Would we feel proud if) Tj
T*
(   this cancellation flow was published on the front page of the New York Times?') Tj
T*
(   - Ethical Design Checklists in CI/CD: Establishing explicit acceptance criteria forbidding) Tj
T*
(   deceptive visual asymmetries between affirmative and negative options.) Tj
T*
(   - Measuring Customer Goodwill Metrics: Replacing short-term conversion rate KPIs with long-term) Tj
T*
(   Customer Lifetime Value \(LTV\) and Net Promoter Score \(NPS\), aligning corporate incentives with) Tj
T*
(   transparent, respectful design.) Tj
